    "description": "Remove the records-commit-trailer input\n\nVercel reads no skip token from a commit message, so the `records-commit-trailer` input added in #10 serves no consumer. This returns `review.yml`, the README and the tests to their state before #10, and keeps one test that pins the records commit message.\n\nAfter merge, move `v1` to the merge commit. The change touches only `review.yml`, so the action pin inside it does not move.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_015qFsP83RdSgDuy1Cj27jH6",
